  "implementation": [
    "Fuse squared differences into the existing per-worker column scratch before horizontal summation; vertical seeding overwrites all accumulator columns. Remove the full difference plane while preserving global strip starts, adaptive heights, horizontal reseeding, border guards and arithmetic order.",
    "Store ordinary local search radii in u8 instead of isize. A wider representation preserves existing public parameters above 255; variance scaling and inverse normalization are unchanged.",
    "Split the private shift kernel and radius storage into small Rust modules; update the existing independent box-sum proof to read input patches directly. No view, shader, pipeline-order, schema or model changes."
  ],
